{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00082","headline":"宴中山 · 太宗皇帝","name":"宴中山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱马出辽阳，万里转旗常。\n对敌六奇举，临戎八阵张。\n斩鲸澄碧海，卷雾扫扶桑。\n昔去兰萦翠，今来桂染芳。\n云芝浮碎叶，冰镜上朝光。\n回首长安道，方欢宴柏梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}